{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21050","headline":"啁少年 · 李贺","name":"啁少年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青騘马肥金鞍光，龙脑入缕罗衫香。\n美人狭坐飞琼觞，贫人唤云天上郎。\n别起高楼临碧筱，丝曳红鳞出深沼。\n有时半醉百花前，背把金丸落飞鸟。\n自说生来未爲客，一身美妾过三百。\n岂知斸地种苗家，官税频催勿人织。\n长得积玉夸豪毅，每揖闲人多意气。\n生来不读半行书，只把黄金买身贵。\n少年安得长少年，海波尚变爲桑田。\n荣枯递传急如箭，天公不肯於公偏。\n莫道韶华镇长在，发白面皱专相待。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}